text: ["({2/B} can be paid with any two mana or with {B}. This card's mana value is 6.)\nSearch your library for a card with mana value less than or equal to the number of lands you control, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.", '({2/G} can be paid with any two mana or with {G}. This card\'s mana value is 6.)\nUntil end of turn, target creature gets +4/+4 and gains trample, wither, and "When this creature attacks, target creature blocks it this turn if able." (It deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)', "({2/R} can be paid with any two mana or with {R}. This card's mana value is 6.)\nFlame Javelin deals 4 damage to any target.", "({2/U} can be paid with any two mana or with {U}. This card's mana value is 6.)\nLook at the top five cards of your library. If you control more creatures than each other player, put two of those cards into your hand. Otherwise, put one of them into your hand. Then put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.", "({2/W} can be paid with any two mana or with {W}. This card's mana value is 10.)\nOther Scarecrow creatures you control get +1/+1.\nWhenever another Scarecrow enters the battlefield under your control, destroy target permanent.", '({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {B}.)\nLeechridden Swamp enters the battlefield tapped.\n{B}, {T}: Each opponent loses 1 life. Activate only if you control two or more black permanents.', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)\nSapseep Forest enters the battlefield tapped.\n{G}, {T}: You gain 1 life. Activate only if you control two or more green permanents.', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)\nMadblind Mountain enters the battlefield tapped.\n{R}, {T}: Shuffle your library. Activate only if you control two or more red permanents.', '({T}: Add {U}.)', "({T}: Add {U}.)\nMoonring Island enters the battlefield tapped.\n{U}, {T}: Look at the top card of target player's library. Activate only if you control two or more blue permanents.", '({T}: Add {W}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)\nMistveil Plains enters the battlefield tapped.\n{W}, {T}: Put target card from your graveyard on the bottom of your library. Activate only if you control two or more white permanents.', 'Add two mana in any combination of colors.\nDraw a card.', 'All permanents are enchantments in addition to their other types.', 'As Lurebound Scarecrow enters the battlefield, choose a color.\nWhen you control no permanents of the chosen color, sacrifice Lurebound Scarecrow.', "As Painter's Servant enters the battlefield, choose a color.\nAll cards that aren't on the battlefield, spells, and permanents are the chosen color in addition to their other colors.", "As Runed Halo enters the battlefield, choose a card name.\nYou have protection from the chosen card name. (You can't be targeted, dealt damage, or enchanted by anything with that name.)", 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, put a -1/-1 counter on a creature you control.\nDraw two cards.', "As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature.\nRite of Consumption deals damage equal to the sacrificed creature's power to target player or planeswalker. You gain life equal to the damage dealt this way.", 'Ashenmoor Cohort gets +1/+1 as long as you control another black creature.', "Ashenmoor Gouger can't block.", 'At the beginning of each end step, each opponent loses life equal to the life they lost this turn. (Damage causes loss of life.)', 'At the beginning of each end step, if an opponent lost 3 or more life this turn, you may draw a card. (Damage causes loss of life.)', "At the beginning of each player's draw step, that player draws an additional card.\nWhenever a player draws a card, Spiteful Visions deals 1 damage to that player.", "At the beginning of your upkeep, if you have no cards in hand, each opponent loses 2 life.\nAt the beginning of each opponent's upkeep, if that player has no cards in hand, they lose 2 life.", "At the beginning of your upkeep, remove a -1/-1 counter from each creature you control.\nPersist (When this creature dies, if it had no -1/-1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a -1/-1 counter on it.)", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you may exchange control of target nonland permanent you control and target nonland permanent an opponent controls with an equal or lesser mana value.', "Barrenton Cragtreads can't be blocked by red creatures.", 'Black creatures you control have wither. (They deal damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)', 'Blazethorn Scarecrow has haste as long as you control a red creature.\nBlazethorn Scarecrow has wither as long as you control a green creature. (It deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)', "Blue creatures you control can't be blocked.", 'Burn Trail deals 3 damage to any target.\nConspire (As you cast this spell, you may tap two untapped creatures you control that share a color with it. When you do, copy it and you may choose a new target for the copy.)', 'Chainbreaker enters the battlefield with two -1/-1 counters on it.\n{3}, {T}: Remove a -1/-1 counter from target creature.', 'Choose one —\n• Target player discards two cards.\n• Target player reveals their hand. You choose a card from it. That player discards that card.', 'Choose three target nonenchantment permanents. Destroy one of them at random.', 'Corrupt deals damage to any target equal to the number of Swamps you control. You gain life equal to the damage dealt this way.', 'Counter target blue instant spell.', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays {1} for each blue permanent you control.', "Counter target spell. Search its controller's graveyard, hand, and library for all cards with the same name as that spell and exile them. Then that player shuffles.", 'Counter target spell. You may shuffle up to one target card from your graveyard into your library.', 'Crabapple Cohort gets +1/+1 as long as you control another green creature.', 'Create a 2/2 green Wolf creature token for each Forest you control.', 'Create a 4/4 red and green Giant Warrior creature token with haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step.\nConspire (As you cast this spell, you may tap two untapped creatures you control that share a color with it. When you do, copy it.)', 'Create a 5/5 black and red Elemental creature token. Target opponent sacrifices a creature for each black creature you control, then sacrifices a land for each red creature you control.', 'Create three 1/1 white Spirit creature tokens with flying.', 'Create two 1/1 white Kithkin Soldier creature tokens if {W} was spent to cast this spell. Counter up to one target creature spell if {U} was spent to cast this spell. (Do both if {W}{U} was spent.)', "Creatures target player controls can't block this turn. Ember Gale deals 1 damage to each white and/or blue creature that player controls.", 'Creatures you control have double strike.', "Deep-Slumber Titan enters the battlefield tapped.\nDeep-Slumber Titan doesn't untap during your untap step.\nWhenever Deep-Slumber Titan is dealt damage, untap it.", 'Defender, flying\nWither (This deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)', 'Destroy all Auras and Equipment attached to target creature.', 'Destroy all artifacts and enchantments. You gain 2 life for each permanent destroyed this way.', 'Destroy all nonwhite creatures.', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.\nConspire (As you cast this spell, you may tap two untapped creatures you control that share a color with it. When you do, copy it and you may choose a new target for the copy.)', "Destroy target artifact. Smash to Smithereens deals 3 damage to that artifact's controller.", 'Destroy target creature with flying. If that creature was blue or black, create a 1/2 green Spider creature token with reach. (It can block creatures with flying.)', 'Destroy target creature. If that creature was green or white, its controller discards a card.', "Destroy target land. Poison the Well deals 2 damage to that land's controller.", 'Draw a card for each Island you control.', 'Draw cards equal to the number of cards target opponent discarded this turn.', 'Draw two cards, then discard a card.\nConspire (As you cast this spell, you may tap two untapped creatures you control that share a color with it. When you do, copy it.)', 'Each other creature becomes a copy of target nonlegendary creature until end of turn.', 'Enchant creature\nAs long as enchanted creature is black, it gets +1/+1 and has wither. (It deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)\nAs long as enchanted creature is red, it gets +1/+1 and has first strike.', 'Enchant creature\nAs long as enchanted creature is blue, it gets +1/+1 and has "Whenever this creature deals damage to an opponent, draw a card."\nAs long as enchanted creature is black, it gets +1/+1 and has "Whenever this creature deals damage to an opponent, that player discards a card."', 'Enchant creature\nAs long as enchanted creature is green, it gets +1/+1 and has indestructible. (Damage and effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy it. If its toughness is 0 or less, it\'s still put into its owner\'s graveyard.)\nAs long as enchanted creature is white, it gets +1/+1 and has flying.', 'Enchant creature\nAs long as enchanted creature is red, it gets +1/+1 and has double strike. (It deals both first-strike and regular combat damage.)\nAs long as enchanted creature is green, it gets +1/+1 and has trample.', "Enchant creature\nAs long as enchanted creature is white, it gets +1/+1 and has lifelink. (Damage dealt by the creature also causes its controller to gain that much life.)\nAs long as enchanted creature is blue, it gets +1/+1 and can't be blocked.", 'Enchant creature\nAt the beginning of each upkeep, tap enchanted creature.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature attacks each combat if able.', "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block, and its activated abilities can't be activated.\nWhenever a creature enters the battlefield under an opponent's control, you may attach Prison Term to that creature.", 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature doesn\'t untap during its controller\'s untap step.\nEnchanted creature has "{1}, Put a -1/-1 counter on this creature: Untap this creature."', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1 for each Plains you control and has flying.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature has "{T}: Create X 1/1 red Elemental creature tokens with haste, where X is this creature\'s power. Exile them at the beginning of the next end step."', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature has "{T}: Create a 1/1 green Elf Warrior creature token."', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature has "{T}: This creature deals 1 damage to any target."', 'Enchant creature\nYou control enchanted creature.\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, put a -1/-1 counter on enchanted creature.', 'Enchant creature\n{1}{B}: Put a -1/-1 counter on enchanted creature.', "Enchant player\nIf a card would be put into enchanted player's graveyard from anywhere, instead that card is revealed and put on the bottom of that player's library.", 'Equipped creature gets +1/+0 and has wither. (It deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)\nEquip {2}', 'Equipped creature has "{3}, {Q}: This creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn." ({Q} is the untap symbol.)\nEquip {0}', 'Exile target creature with power 2 or less. Its controller gains 4 life.', "Exile target creature. Return that card to the battlefield under its owner's control at the beginning of the next end step.", "Fear (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)\nCrowd of Cinders's power and toughness are each equal to the number of black permanents you control.", "Fear (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)\n{2}{U}{B}: Each unblocked creature has base power and toughness 4/1 until end of turn.", 'Firespout deals 3 damage to each creature without flying if {R} was spent to cast this spell and 3 damage to each creature with flying if {G} was spent to cast this spell. (Do both if {R}{G} was spent.)', 'First strike\nBallynock Cohort gets +1/+1 as long as you control another white creature.', 'First strike\nWither (This deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)', 'Flash', 'Flash\nDefender, flying', 'Flash\nEnchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets -3/-0.', 'Flash\nFlying\nWhen Glamer Spinners enters the battlefield, attach all Auras enchanting target permanent to another permanent with the same controller.', 'Flash\nOther white creatures you control get +1/+1.\nOther blue creatures you control get +1/+1.', 'Flash\nWhen Prismwake Merrow enters the battlefield, target permanent becomes the color or colors of your choice until end of turn.', 'Flying', 'Flying\nAttacking creatures you control have lifelink.', 'Flying\nBriarberry Cohort gets +1/+1 as long as you control another blue creature.', 'Flying\nDiscard Faerie Macabre: Exile up to two target cards from graveyards.', "Flying\nFaerie Swarm's power and toughness are each equal to the number of blue permanents you control.", "Flying\nIf a source would deal damage to Swans of Bryn Argoll, prevent that damage. The source's controller draws cards equal to the damage prevented this way.", 'Flying\nOther blue creatures you control get +1/+1.\nOther black creatures you control get +1/+1.', 'Flying\nOther creatures have base power and toughness 1/1.', "Flying\nTatterkite can't have counters put on it.", 'Flying\nWhen Knollspine Dragon enters the battlefield, you may discard your hand and draw cards equal to the damage dealt to target opponent this turn.', "Flying\nWhen Puppeteer Clique enters the battlefield, put target creature card from an opponent's graveyard onto the battlefield under your control. It gains haste. At the beginning of your next end step, exile it.\nPersist (When this creature dies, if it had no -1/-1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a -1/-1 counter on it.)", 'Flying\nWhenever Goldenglow Moth blocks, you may gain 4 life.', 'Flying\nWhenever Kinscaer Harpoonist attacks, you may have target creature lose flying until end of turn.', "Flying\nWither (This deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)\nCreatures your opponents control with counters on them can't attack or block.", 'Flying\n{1}{U}, {Q}: Target opponent exiles the top card of their library. Until end of turn, you may play that card. ({Q} is the untap symbol.)', 'Flying\n{1}{W/U}, {Q}: Tap target creature. ({Q} is the untap symbol.)', 'Flying\n{2}, {Q}: Add one mana of any color. ({Q} is the untap symbol.)', 'Flying\n{B/R}: Blistering Dieflyn gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Flying\n{G/W}{G/W}: Rune-Cervin Rider gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flying\n{X}{U/B}: Choose a color. Target opponent exiles the top X cards of their library. For each card of the chosen color exiled this way, create a 1/1 blue and black Faerie Rogue creature token with flying.', "Flying, vigilance\nWhen Twilight Shepherd enters the battlefield, return to your hand all cards in your graveyard that were put there from the battlefield this turn.\nPersist (When this creature dies, if it had no -1/-1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a -1/-1 counter on it.)", "Ghastlord of Fugue can't be blocked.\nWhenever Ghastlord of Fugue deals combat damage to a player, that player reveals their hand. You choose a card from it. That player exiles that card.", 'Green creatures you control have trample.', 'Grief Tyrant enters the battlefield with four -1/-1 counters on it.\nWhen Grief Tyrant dies, put a -1/-1 counter on target creature for each -1/-1 counter on Grief Tyrant.', 'Grim Poppet enters the battlefield with three -1/-1 counters on it.\nRemove a -1/-1 counter from Grim Poppet: Put a -1/-1 counter on another target creature.', 'Haste\nMudbrawler Cohort gets +1/+1 as long as you control another red creature.', 'Haste\nWither (This deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)', 'Haste\n{R}: Pyre Charger gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Haste\n{T}: Target black or red creature gains haste until end of turn.', "Hexproof\nDrove of Elves's power and toughness are each equal to the number of green permanents you control.", 'If Mossbridge Troll would be destroyed, regenerate it.\nTap any number of untapped creatures you control other than Mossbridge Troll with total power 10 or greater: Mossbridge Troll gets +20/+20 until end of turn.', 'If you tap a permanent for mana, it produces twice as much of that mana instead.', 'If you would draw a card, draw two cards instead.', 'If you would gain life, you gain twice that much life instead.', "If {U} was spent to cast this spell, return up to one target creature to its owner's hand. If {B} was spent to cast this spell, target player reveals their hand, you choose a nonland card from it, then that player discards that card. (Do both if {U}{B} was spent.)", "Inkfathom Infiltrator can't block and can't be blocked.", 'Jaws of Stone deals X damage divided as you choose among any number of targets, where X is the number of Mountains you control as you cast this spell.', 'Lands you control are every basic land type in addition to their other types.', 'Leech Bonder enters the battlefield with two -1/-1 counters on it.\n{U}, {Q}: Move a counter from target creature onto a second target creature. ({Q} is the untap symbol.)', 'Lifelink, protection from mana value 3 or greater', "Menace (This creature can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)\nHorde of Boggarts's power and toughness are each equal to the number of red permanents you control.", 'Morselhoarder enters the battlefield with two -1/-1 counters on it.\nRemove a -1/-1 counter from Morselhoarder: Add one mana of any color.', 'Move all counters from target creature onto another target creature.', "Mudbrawler Raiders can't be blocked by blue creatures.", 'Other black creatures you control get +1/+1.\nOther red creatures you control get +1/+1.\nWhenever Ashenmoor Liege becomes the target of a spell or ability an opponent controls, that player loses 4 life.', "Other enchantments you control have shroud. (A permanent with shroud can't be the target of spells or abilities.)\nEnchanted creatures you control have shroud.", 'Other green creatures you control get +1/+1.\nOther white creatures you control get +1/+1.\nIf a spell or ability an opponent controls causes you to discard Wilt-Leaf Liege, put it onto the battlefield instead of putting it into your graveyard.', "Persist (When this creature dies, if it had no -1/-1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a -1/-1 counter on it.)", "Plainswalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Plains.)\n{2}{R}, Sacrifice Boggart Arsonists: Destroy target Scarecrow or Plains.", "Players can't gain life.\nDamage can't be prevented.\nAll damage is dealt as though its source had wither. (A source with wither deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)", 'Prevent all damage target attacking or blocking creature would deal this turn. If that creature is black or red, destroy it.', 'Protection from blue, from black, and from red', 'Puncture Bolt deals 1 damage to target creature. Put a -1/-1 counter on that creature.', 'Put a -1/-1 counter on target creature, two -1/-1 counters on another target creature, and three -1/-1 counters on a third target creature.', 'Put a -1/-1 counter on target creature.', "Put target attacking or blocking creature on top of its owner's library.\nConspire (As you cast this spell, you may tap two untapped creatures you control that share a color with it. When you do, copy it and you may choose a new target for the copy.)", "Rattleblaze Scarecrow has persist as long as you control a black creature. (When this creature dies, if it had no -1/-1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a -1/-1 counter on it.)\nRattleblaze Scarecrow has haste as long as you control a red creature.", "Raven's Run Dragoon can't be blocked by black creatures.", 'Reach\nGloomwidow can block only creatures with flying.', 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)\nWither (This deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)', 'Red creatures you control have first strike.', 'Regenerate target permanent.', 'Return a card at random from your graveyard to your hand, then reorder your graveyard as you choose.', "Return all permanents to their owners' hands. Each player chooses up to seven cards in their hand, then shuffles the rest into their library. Each player loses all unspent mana.", "Return target artifact or enchantment card from a graveyard to its owner's hand.\nConspire (As you cast this spell, you may tap two untapped creatures you control that share a color with it. When you do, copy it and you may choose a new target for the copy.)", "Return target creature card from a graveyard to its owner's hand.\nConspire (As you cast this spell, you may tap two untapped creatures you control that share a color with it. When you do, copy it and you may choose a new target for the copy.)", "Return target permanent to its owner's hand. If that permanent is red or green, put it on top of its owner's library instead.", 'Return up to one target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield if {B} was spent to cast this spell. Creatures target player controls get +2/+0 and gain haste until end of turn if {R} was spent to cast this spell. (Do both if {B}{R} was spent.)', 'Sacrifice Cursecatcher: Counter target instant or sorcery spell unless its controller pays {1}.', 'Sacrifice Fulminator Mage: Destroy target nonbasic land.', 'Sacrifice Heap Doll: Exile target card from a graveyard.', 'Search your library for a Forest or Plains card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', "Shroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)\nIsleback Spawn gets +4/+8 as long as a library has twenty or fewer cards in it.", "Sootwalkers can't be blocked by white creatures.", 'Starting with you, each player may pay any amount of life. Repeat this process until no one pays life. Each player creates a 1/1 black Rat creature token for each 1 life they paid this way.', 'Take an extra turn after this one. Skip the untap step of that turn.', 'Tap all creatures your opponents control and untap all creatures you control.', 'Tap target untapped creature. It deals damage equal to its power to its controller.\nConspire (As you cast this spell, you may tap two untapped creatures you control that share a color with it. When you do, copy it and you may choose a new target for the copy.)', "Target creature becomes black and gains fear until end of turn. (It can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)\nDraw a card.", 'Target creature becomes blue until end of turn. Untap that creature.\nDraw a card.', 'Target creature becomes green and gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\nDraw a card.', 'Target creature becomes red and gains haste until end of turn.\nDraw a card.', 'Target creature becomes white until end of turn. Tap that creature.\nDraw a card.', 'Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.\nConspire (As you cast this spell, you may tap two untapped creatures you control that share a color with it. When you do, copy it and you may choose a new target for the copy.)', "Target creature's controller sacrifices it, then creates X 1/1 green and white Elf Warrior creature tokens, where X is that creature's power.", 'Target player discards their hand unless they pay 7 life.', 'Target player mills four cards.\nConspire (As you cast this spell, you may tap two untapped creatures you control that share a color with it. When you do, copy it and you may choose a new target for the copy.)', 'Tattermunge Maniac attacks each combat if able.', "This spell can't be countered.\n{R/G}: Target spell can't be countered.", 'Thornwatch Scarecrow has wither as long as you control a green creature. (It deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)\nThornwatch Scarecrow has vigilance as long as you control a white creature.', 'Trample\nOther red creatures you control get +1/+1.\nOther green creatures you control get +1/+1.', "Trample\nPersist (When this creature dies, if it had no -1/-1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a -1/-1 counter on it.)", "Trample\nWhen Woodfall Primus enters the battlefield, destroy target noncreature permanent.\nPersist (When this creature dies, if it had no -1/-1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a -1/-1 counter on it.)", 'Trample\nWhenever Deus of Calamity deals 6 or more damage to an opponent, destroy target land that player controls.', 'Trample\nWhenever Hungry Spriggan attacks, it gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', "Trample\nWhenever Spawnwrithe deals combat damage to a player, create a token that's a copy of Spawnwrithe.", 'Vigilance', "Vigilance\nKithkin Rabble's power and toughness are each equal to the number of white permanents you control.", "Wanderbrine Rootcutters can't be blocked by green creatures.", 'Watchwing Scarecrow has vigilance as long as you control a white creature.\nWatchwing Scarecrow has flying as long as you control a blue creature.', "When Cragganwick Cremator enters the battlefield, discard a card at random. If you discard a creature card this way, Cragganwick Cremator deals damage equal to that card's power to target player or planeswalker.", 'When Cultbrand Cinder enters the battlefield, put a -1/-1 counter on target creature.', 'When Elsewhere Flask enters the battlefield, draw a card.\nSacrifice Elsewhere Flask: Choose a basic land type. Each land you control becomes that type until end of turn.', 'When Farhaven Elf enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'When Furystoke Giant enters the battlefield, other creatures you control gain "{T}: This creature deals 2 damage to any target" until end of turn.\nPersist (When this creature dies, if it had no -1/-1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner\'s control with a -1/-1 counter on it.)', "When Kitchen Finks enters the battlefield, you gain 2 life.\nPersist (When this creature dies, if it had no -1/-1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a -1/-1 counter on it.)", 'When Medicine Runner enters the battlefield, you may remove a counter from target permanent.', "When Murderous Redcap enters the battlefield, it deals damage equal to its power to any target.\nPersist (When this creature dies, if it had no -1/-1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a -1/-1 counter on it.)", 'When Somnomancer enters the battlefield, you may tap target creature.', 'When Wort, the Raidmother enters the battlefield, create two 1/1 red and green Goblin Warrior creature tokens.\nEach red or green instant or sorcery spell you cast has conspire. (As you cast the spell, you may tap two untapped creatures you control that share a color with it. When you do, copy it and you may choose new targets for the copy.)', 'When you cast this spell, return all cards named Demigod of Revenge from your graveyard to the battlefield.\nFlying, haste', 'Whenever Augury Adept deals combat damage to a player, reveal the top card of your library and put that card into your hand. You gain life equal to its mana value.', 'Whenever Dusk Urchins attacks or blocks, put a -1/-1 counter on it.\nWhen Dusk Urchins dies, draw a card for each -1/-1 counter on it.', 'Whenever Hollowsage becomes untapped, you may have target player discard a card.', "Whenever River Kelpie or another permanent enters the battlefield from a graveyard, draw a card.\nWhenever a player casts a spell from a graveyard, draw a card.\nPersist (When this creature dies, if it had no -1/-1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a -1/-1 counter on it.)", 'Whenever Wicker Warcrawler attacks or blocks, put a -1/-1 counter on it at end of combat.', 'Whenever Witherscale Wurm blocks or becomes blocked by a creature, that creature gains wither until end of turn. (It deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)\nWhenever Witherscale Wurm deals damage to an opponent, remove all -1/-1 counters from it.', 'Whenever a -1/-1 counter is put on a creature, you may create a 1/1 green Elf Warrior creature token.', 'Whenever a blue creature enters the battlefield under your control, you may have target player draw a card.\nWhenever a black creature enters the battlefield under your control, you may have target player discard a card.', 'Whenever a creature dies, if it had a -1/-1 counter on it, put a -1/-1 counter on target creature.', 'Whenever a creature dies, you may pay {1}. If you do, Cemetery Puca becomes a copy of that creature, except it has this ability.', 'Whenever a creature with flying attacks you, Raking Canopy deals 4 damage to it.', "Whenever a land enters the battlefield under an opponent's control, that player loses 2 life and you gain 2 life.", 'Whenever a player casts a black spell, you may pay {1}. If you do, target player loses 1 life.', 'Whenever a player casts a blue spell, you may pay {1}. If you do, target player mills two cards.', 'Whenever a player casts a green spell, you may pay {1}. If you do, target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', "Whenever a player casts a red spell, you may pay {1}. If you do, target creature can't block this turn.", 'Whenever a player casts a white spell, you may pay {1}. If you do, you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever you cast a black spell, Emberstrike Duo gets +1/+1 until end of turn.\nWhenever you cast a red spell, Emberstrike Duo gains first strike until end of turn.', "Whenev