ou gain 1 life for each tapped artifact, creature, and land you control.', 'You gain X life if {G} was spent to cast this spell and X life if {W} was spent to cast this spell. (Do both if {G}{W} was spent.)', "You may cast target instant or sorcery card from an opponent's graveyard without paying its mana cost.", 'You may put a green creature card from your hand onto the battlefield.', '{1}, {T}, Reveal two cards from your hand that share a color: Draw a card.', '{1}, {T}, Tap an untapped creature you control: Target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{1}: Add {B} or {R}. Activate no more than three times each turn.', '{1}: Scrapbasket becomes all colors until end of turn.', '{1}{U/B}, {Q}: Target creature gets -2/-0 until end of turn. ({Q} is the untap symbol.)', '{1}{U}, {Q}: Merrow Wavebreakers gains flying until end of turn. ({Q} is the untap symbol.)', '{1}{W}{W}, {Q}: Return target creature card with mana value 3 or less from your graveyard to the battlefield. ({Q} is the untap symbol.)', '{2}, {T}: Tap target creature.', "{2}{G/W}, {T}: Create a 1/1 green and white Elf Warrior creature token.\n{4}{G/W}{G/W}, {T}: For each creature token you control, create a token that's a copy of that creature.", '{2}{G}{W}: Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn. Untap that creature.', "{2}{R/G}: Reveal the top card of your library. If it isn't a creature card, put it into your graveyard. Otherwise, put that card onto the battlefield. That creature gains haste. Sacrifice it at the beginning of the next end step.", '{2}{W}, {Q}: Safehold Sentry gets +0/+2 until end of turn. ({Q} is the untap symbol.)', "{2}{W}{U}: Exile target creature. Return that card to the battlefield under its owner's control at the beginning of the next end step.", "{2}{W}{W}, {Q}: Target creature gains protection from the color of its controller's choice until end of turn. ({Q} is the untap symbol.)", '{4}, {T}: Put a -1/-1 counter on target creature.', '{B}{R}: Each player loses 1 life.'